Third-party Web UI components in Hadoop 2.10.2 and 3.4.3
======================================================

Bundled under webapps/static/ in lib/hadoop-yarn-common-2.10.2.jar
and lib/hadoop-client-api-3.4.3.jar, including compressed .gz copies.
Images and themes distributed with these components are included.
MIT is selected where MIT/GPL choices are offered; BSD-3-Clause is
selected for DataTables 1.9.4. Original notices in resources are retained.

